## Action Sequence

| Order | Action | Depends On | Blocks |
|-------|--------|------------|--------|
| 1 | [First action] | None | [Actions 2, 3] |
| 2 | [Second action] | [Action 1] | [Action 4] |
| 3 | [Third action] | [Action 1] | None |
````

